---
import SimplePage from '../../components/SimplePage.astro';
import BookingPanel from '../../components/BookingPanel.astro';
import { business } from '../../data/business';
---
<SimplePage title={`HVAC Financing | ${business.displayName}`} description={`Financing is available for new furnaces, boilers, air conditioners and heat pumps, subject to credit approval. Free estimates. ${business.phoneDisplay}.`}
  h1="HVAC financing" lead={`Financing through ${business.financingPartner} for new heating and cooling systems, subject to credit approval.`} crumb="Financing" path="/financing/" eyebrow="Financing">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container fin-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Financing for new heating and cooling systems installed by {business.displayName} is available through <strong>{business.financingPartner}</strong>, subject to credit approval. Ask about current plans during your free estimate, or call {business.phoneDisplay}.</p>
        <!-- TODO(owner): an Optimus prequalification link would let customers apply online. -->
        <h2>What can be financed</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/furnace-installation/">Furnace replacement</a></li>
          <li><a href="/boiler-installation/">Boiler replacement</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ac-installation/">Central air conditioning</a></li>
          <li><a href="/heat-pump-installation/">Heat pumps</a> and <a href="/mini-split-installation/">ductless mini-splits</a></li>
          <li>Indoor air quality equipment installed with a new system</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>How it works</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>We visit, size the system and give you a free written estimate with options.</li>
          <li>If you’d like to finance, we explain the available {business.financingPartner} plans and terms. Approval depends on {business.financingPartner}’s credit review.</li>
          <li>Once approved and you’ve chosen a system, we schedule the installation.</li>
        </ol>
        <h2>Other ways to lower the cost</h2>
        <p>Ask about utility rebates and incentives that may apply to qualifying high-efficiency equipment and heat pumps. Eligibility rules change, so we check what’s current for your equipment and address.</p>
      </div>
      <BookingPanel funnel="quote" placement="financing" />
    </div>
  </section>
</SimplePage>
<style>
  .fin-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); align-items: start; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .fin-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
